coverage exclude -src ../rtl/apbif.v -code b -line 56 -comment {the SETUP phase lasts for exactly 1 clock cycle. In the subsequent cycle, Master must assert tim_penable (while keeping tim_psel active) to transition to the ACCESS phase. Therefore, this condition will always evaluate to TRUE.}
